# One symbol per line — blocks X-SIGNAL eligibility/planning for that asset only.
# Copy to .xsignal_blocked_symbols (gitignored) to enable. Lines starting with # are ignored.
#
# Do not block every asset in followed_equities.json — if the block list would remove all
# assets, nanoclaw ignores blocks for that cycle and logs a WARNING.
#
# Example (uncomment to use):
# WMATIC_ALPHA
# WETH_ALPHA
